Codices (''codex,'' when singular) are pieces of ancient writing that can be found in loot chests and boxes. Each piece contains a piece of the Worlds Adrift lore. A piece of writing usually from the old world of Foundation, but some stories take place after the world fell apart. Currently, all the codex pieces are from either the [[Sabor|Saborian]] culture, or the [[Kioki Unity|Kioki]] culture though as more cultures are added to the game this will expand to encompass all of them.

Collecting a codex piece in-game will give you 15 to 100 knowledge per piece, depending on rarity.

